  "displayName": "循環 — Analysis-Only Societal Feedback-Loop Observer",
  "displayNameJa": "循環",
  "displayNameEn": "Junkan",
  "description": "Non-profit religious-corp artificial-organism observer that performs systems-thinking on society at large: from passive, public, aggregate data it continuously builds a system-dynamics model — stocks, flows, reinforcing (R) / balancing (B) causal loops — and reads off which loops are currently spinning virtuous (好循環), vicious (悪循環), neutral, or transitioning, plus Meadows leverage-point candidates. ANALYSIS-ONLY: junkan has NO outward channel (no AT Proto post, no @mention, no email, no nudge, no transaction, no actuator); its only output is append-only structured findings consumed by Council + other actors (G4 defining gate, enforced by ABSENCE of any dispatch cell). Outward sibling of the inward active-inference prior (doc 2605221243) + KaizenObserver (ADR-2605240200, self-model); distinct from ossekai (ADR-2605264000, an intervention actor). Data model = datom / Datalog (immutable society-stock facts + time-travel) realized on canonical kotoba-kqe (ADR-2605262130, Datomic-isomorphic EAVT/AEVT/AVET/VAET); proprietary Datomic NOT used (Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c)). LangGraph heartbeat-cadence Pregel graph. PASSIVE-ONLY collection (G3 per ADR-2605262400). Aggregate-only / no individual modeling (G6). No causal overclaim (G5, hypothesis-only). No prescription / no prediction-as-fact (G11). NO commercial systems-analysis/BI/intel SaaS (G8: Palantir / Recorded Future / Dataminr / Quid / SAS / Stella Architect / Vensim commercial / AnyLogic commercial / Powersim PROHIBITED). Murakumo-only inference (G10). 8 cells / 5 Lexicons / 13 gates / 12 non-goals.",
  "descriptionJa": "非営利 religious-corp の人工生命体 observer。社会全体に system-thinking を適用し、passive かつ公開・集約データから system-dynamics モデル (stock / flow / 強化 R・均衡 B の causal loop) を継続構築し、各 loop が今 好循環 / 悪循環 / 中立 / 遷移中 のどれで回っているか + Meadows leverage-point 候補を読み取る。分析専用: junkan は外向きチャネルを一切持たない (AT Proto post / @mention / email / nudge / 取引 / actuator なし)。出力は append-only の構造化 finding のみで、Council + 他 actor が読む (G4 = 定義 gate; dispatch cell の不在によって構造的に保証)。内向きの active-inference prior (doc 2605221243) + KaizenObserver (ADR-2605240200) の外向き sibling。介入 actor である ossekai (ADR-2605264000) とは別物。データモデル = datom / Datalog (不変な社会 stock fact + time-travel) を canonical な kotoba-kqe (ADR-2605262130, Datomic 同型 EAVT/AEVT/AVET/VAET) 上で実現; proprietary Datomic は不使用 (Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c))。LangGraph heartbeat-cadence Pregel graph。PASSIVE-ONLY 収集 (G3 per ADR-2605262400)。集約のみ / 個人モデル化なし (G6)。因果の過剰主張なし (G5, 仮説のみ)。処方なし / 予測を事実扱いしない (G11)。商業 systems-analysis/BI/intel SaaS 禁止 (G8)。Murakumo-only inference (G10)。8 cell / 5 Lexicon / 13 gate / 12 non-goal。",
